# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite

# VCS / editor / OS noise
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.worktrees
**/.claude
**/.DS_Store
**/npm-debug.log
**/*.log

# Secrets: never send env files into the build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Runtime data
**/uploads
**/coverage
